      "owner": null,
      "modifiedTime": 1697759157000,
      "replicatedTo": null,
      "userDescription": "Order line items from TPC-H benchmark (SF1). Contains 6 million line-level details: quantity, pricing, discount, tax, shipping dates, and return status.\r\nComposite key: (L_ORDERKEY, L_LINENUMBER).\r\nKey calculations:\r\n- L_EXTENDEDPRICE = L_QUANTITY x unit_price (from PARTSUPP)\r\n- Revenue = L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (1 - L_DISCOUNT)\r\n- Net amount = Revenue * (1 + L_TAX)\r\n\r\nFR: Lignes de commande (TPC-H SF1). 6M de lignes de detail. Calculs cles : L_EXTENDEDPRICE = L_QUANTITY x prix_unitaire ; Revenu = L_EXTENDEDPRICE * (1 - L_DISCOUNT) ; Montant net = Revenu * (1 + L_TAX).",
      "replicatedFrom": null,
      "qualifiedName": "snowflake://https/databases/SNOWFLAKE_SAMPLE_DATA/schemas/TPCH_SF1/tables/LINEITEM",
      "displayName": null,
